        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 5,
        "ActorName": "Dudu",
        "ActorTalk": "Our lab conducts genetic modifications under one core principle: preserving biodiversity.",
        "Cv": null,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 6,
        "ActorName": "Dudu",
        "ActorTalk": "And these display plants you're seeing now are the result of all that work.",
